  "description": "<p>If the --bagitProfile default|APTrust is used:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>triggers the creation of a bag</li>\n\t<li>fails if bag already exists</li>\n\t<li>for APTrust profile, see \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2222\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2222\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"BagIt Profile for APTrust\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2222\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n</li>\n\t<li>for default profile, see \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2224\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2224\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Create default fcrepo-import-export Bag Profile\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2224\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n</li>\n\t<li>upon import, verifies checksums in manifest</li>\n\t<li>create tag-manifest</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Considerations</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Audit events &#8211; provenance data from bag-info &#8211; external events</li>\n</ul>\n",
